+### Session 071 addendum — 2026-08-11 (Gate B CLEARED)
+**Agent:** E2 Agent (Emergent, Neo)
+**Scope:** `XS` (approved schema migration to the managed database + documentation; zero repository application/schema file changes)
+**Triggered by:** Operator reviewed the prepared authorization packet and approved exactly: "Create the 18 pinned OnCall Foot tables in the verified managed Supabase database — Option B approved" (target `aws-0-us-west-2` pooler :5432 only; reviewed plan SHA-256 `f765cf97…`; one transaction with auto-rollback; explicitly excluding application changes, seed data, RLS, auth configuration, extra extensions, and the Race-Proof partial unique index).
+
+**What was done:**
+- **Authorization packet first (no execution):** exact non-secret target, same-tenant confirmation, pinned schema provenance (main `f17bdcec…`; schema dir tree `2c5feac6160deee7c4ce13496b0304f02eec0ea0`; source sha256 `2af45e443ff41e61ada7b1a7d7f130e9ba5ca561b60ebe55856e64ba79aeec37`; 18 tables), offline-generated full SQL plan (18 CREATE TABLE, 14 CREATE TYPE, 12 indexes, 34 FKs, **0 destructive statements**), and read-only writability confirmation. Execution stayed blocked until the explicit approval above.
+- **Option B execution:** plan hash re-verified programmatically (abort-on-mismatch), then the reviewed SQL applied byte-for-byte in ONE transaction — COMMITTED.
+- **Immediate read-only catalog re-check:** **18/18 pinned tables present, 0 absent, 0 unexpected — FULL MATCH**; scope audit confirmed exactly 14 enum types, 12 non-constraint indexes, 34 foreign keys, and 0 rows (no seed data).
+- **Independent verification:** separate testing agent re-ran the clearance checks read-only — **16/16 passed** (exact table-set match, object counts, structural spot-checks, empty tables, read-only + rollback, secret hygiene).
+- Secret handled throughout in a mode-600 env file outside the git tree; never printed, logged, committed, or patched. The lost pinned verifier (`df1465bb…`) was never reconstructed; all verifiers/hashes in this session are new and clearly labeled.
+
+**Files changed:**
+- `.agents/LOG.md` (this addendum)
+- `.agents/NEXT_TASK.md` (Priority 1 → CLEARED)
+
+**Build state at end:** **GATE B: CLEARED** on an actual 18/18 result — the managed Supabase database now holds exactly the pinned OnCall Foot schema and nothing else (no data, no RLS, no auth config, no extra extensions, no race-proof index). Repository application and schema files untouched. Full run record: `/app/memory/GATE_B_RUN_2026-08-11.md`; artifacts: `GATE_B_MIGRATION_AUTHORIZATION_PACKET.md`, `GATE_B_MIGRATION_PLAN.sql` (sha256 `f765cf97…`).
+
+**Next best action:** (1) Race-Proof partial unique index on bookings as its own authorization + reviewed schema task (now unblocked); (2) decide the managed-database seed policy through its own approval; (3) Phase 4C stack-native port PLAN (plan only). Production event writes / activation phases remain subject to their own approvals.
